    <p class="cod-eyebrow">When everything else felt wrong, maybe this feels right?</p>
    <h2 class="cod-h1">CUE: THE CONTENT BUNDLE</h2>
    <div class="cod-hscroll">
      <div class="cod-hscroll-track" id="benefitTrack">
        <article class="cod-benefit" style="background-image:url('/assets/content-ondemand/card-graphic-a.png')">
          <h3>Quick Turnaround</h3>
          <p>Turn your ideas into ready-to-post content in just a few days. No endless feedback cycles, no second-guessing yourself, and no 12 hours wasted trying to get it just right on Canva.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cod-benefit" style="background-image:url('/assets/content-ondemand/card-graphic-b.png')">
          <h3>NO STRINGS ATTACHED</h3>
          <p>Get the best quality content whenever you want it, without having to commit to a 3-month contract (although you'll probably want one after the first deliverable).</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cod-benefit" style="background-image:url('/assets/content-ondemand/card-graphic-b.png')">
          <h3>100% FLEXIBILITY</h3>
          <p>Post it today. Or tomorrow. Or next month. Swap out an image last minute on your editable file. Save your bundle for a rainy (busy) day. Do you.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cod-benefit" style="background-image:url('/assets/content-ondemand/card-graphic-b.png')">
          <h3>STILL SO YOU</h3>
          <p>The essence of your content will always be you, and pretty graphics can never replace that. Every idea starts with you and your unique POV.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cod-benefit" style="background-image:url('/assets/content-ondemand/card-graphic-a.png')">
          <h3>REUSE &amp; RECYCLE</h3>
          <p>You get access to the editable Canva file along with final delivery. The perfect base to create unlimited combinations within your brand world.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="#pricing" class="cod-btn cod-cta-hero">UN-GHOST MY GRID</a>
