  <!-- ============ AGITATION (transparent / red) ============ -->
  <section class="cod-agitation" id="agitation">
    <div class="cod-agitation-inner">
      <h2 class="cod-h1 cod-cream">IT'S HARD TO GIVE UP CONTROL OVER YOUR CONTENT WHEN YOU'RE AN INDUSTRY LEADER WITH A UNIQUE POV.</h2>
      <div class="cod-agitation-cols">
        <div class="cod-agitation-left">
          <p>And that's why we never ask you to do that.</p>
          <p>It's harder when you care about your content, and that's just the truth.</p>
          <p>You haven't posted in weeks because well ...</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your launch period is over</li>
            <li>You've got too much client work</li>
            <li>You've got decision fatigue</li>
            <li>You forgot what that content idea was</li>
          </ul>
          <p>But also because you care about what goes up.</p>
          <p>If content was just a chore to you, you would've found a shortcut by now and slapped something up on your grid.</p>
          <p>We know how much you care, because we do too. Nothing goes into the bundle just for the sake of it and that's a guarantee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cod-agitation-right">
          <p>The Signature Bundle helps translate your brand's essence and unique POV into ready-to-deploy content pieces. It's a way for you to get all the ideas out of your head and onto your grid when you just don't have the time or the energy to make it yourself, or want it looking 10x better than you could ever make it.</p>
          <div class="cod-fromto">
            <p class="cod-fromto-label">From</p>
            <p class="cod-fromto-word">“I need content”</p>
            <span class="cod-fromto-arrow">→</span>
            <p class="cod-fromto-word lime">“ready to post”</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS (cream card) ============ -->
  <section class="cod-card cod-how" id="how-it-works">
    <p class="cod-eyebrow">Grab your Signature Bundle</p>
    <h2 class="cod-h1">How it all works:</h2>
    <div class="cod-steps">
      <div class="cod-step tilt-l">
        <span class="cod-step-num">01</span>
        <h3>Grab your Signature Bundle</h3>
        <p>You've said yes to a content bank that looks, sounds, and feels like your brand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cod-step tilt-r">
        <span class="cod-step-num">02</span>
        <h3>Tell us everything</h3>
        <p>Fill out our Content 🤝 Brand questionnaire with goals, audience, tone, references, brand assets, and raw ideas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cod-step tilt-l">
        <span class="cod-step-num">03</span>
        <h3>Review the direction</h3>
        <p>Before we design, we send over the content ideas so you can make sure we're building in the right direction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cod-step tilt-r">
        <span class="cod-step-num">04</span>
        <h3>Review your draft</h3>
        <p>Once approved, we create your graphics, post copy and captions, packaged for Draft 1 feedback.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cod-step tilt-l">
        <span class="cod-step-num">05</span>
        <h3>Post when you're ready</h3>
        <p>After revisions, your final bundle lands in your inbox, ready to post whenever your calendar needs it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
