        <h3 class="cod-founder-hi">Hi, I'm Aishwarya,</h3>
        <p>and I've always known that I was meant to be creative. Whether it was making "all the best wisdom-tooth extraction" cards for my parents or being the self-assigned head of frosting at my mom's home bakery, I've loved the idea of creating something out of nothing.</p>
        <p>One degree in Visual Communication, countless freelance projects, and multiple agency partnerships later, <strong>Content on Demand</strong> was born. On a simple hunch that there was still space for a better content solution — and 180+ bundles later, I can safely have others attest to it.</p>
        <p>Content to me is not a rectangle on your grid, but an extension of your brand's world. It's a chance for you to speak, to show, and to invite people into your world. <strong>It IS that deep to me.</strong></p>
